            <p class="font-body text-lg text-foreground/78 leading-relaxed">Sessions can explore workplace stress, difficult conversations, boundaries, motivation, conflict and adjustment directly. Where an employee comes because their performance is under strain, the counselling still remains separate from the employer’s performance-management process. The counsellor helps them think through constructive next steps, and does not become an evaluator for management.</p>
