        <div class="font-body text-lg text-foreground/78 leading-relaxed space-y-6 max-w-[65ch] mb-12">
          <p>Some patterns cannot be resolved in private counselling, because they do not belong to any one person. Facilitated sessions give colleagues a structured way to address tension, rebuild communication, and get clear about what actually needs to change.</p>
          <p>These sessions are kept distinct from any employee’s private counselling. Participation, purpose, confidentiality and who will receive any feedback are all agreed in advance, so that nobody is surprised by the role the facilitator is playing.</p>
